															</div>
				<div class="info">
					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/a-random-day" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1841781); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1841781&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606661397" alt="A Random Day" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1841781)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/a-random-day" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1841781); return false;" >A Random Day</a></span> <span class="odate time_1468463335 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">14 Jul 2016 02:28</span>
														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-2537552">
									

<p>I started writing this more than two years ago. I don't remember exactly when - but I do recall working on this in June 2014. I shelved it for a couple years because it was even more bloated garbage than it is now. Then the bug hit me to do a long-form SCP, and I figured, why not resurrect this, but better?</p>
<p>Shoutout to PeppersGhost for reviving The Chicago Spirit, one of the coolest Groups of Interest around.</p>
<p>See more of my work on my <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/dr-arvind-desais-personnel-file">author page</a>!</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;Image&nbsp;credits</a></div>
