<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>smallpox.jpg: Gloucester smallpox epidemic, 1896: Ethel Cromwell<br />
This file is licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International license. This file comes from Wellcome Images, a website operated by Wellcome Trust, a global charitable foundation based in the United Kingdom. Refer to Wellcome blog post (archive).</p>
</div>
