<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>First off, I owe a major debt of gratitude towards Captain Cain, TwistedGears, thekillerax, and GottaGoFeast, who looked at the first incarnation of this two years ago and convinced me that it needed a massive overhaul.<br />
I also owe AidenEldritch big time for frequently re-reading it and hyping it up for others to critique.</p>
<p>Many thanks to Conwell and kol aumer for helping me compress the containment procedures.<br />
Many thanks to TroyL, weizhong, Kate McTiriss, rumetzen, and Lex1nat0r for helping me nail down the antiquated writing tone and find sources from which to emulate said tone.<br />
I also wholeheartedly recommend [www.archive.org] as an immensely valuable resource for anyone seeking first-hand sources for antiquated SCP writing.<br />
Many thanks to thedeadlymoose for convincing me to rewrite the US Government's involvement in the SCP.<br />
Thanks to GreenWolf, Sudypt, ThatGuyRiverside, and everyone else I bugged into reading.</p>
